580
00:54:33,000 --> 00:54:42,000
Vîdyo me wuro xalos, diqedê. Û bi me ra bin, helqok din,
hecer... bîr mekin, layk û îştîrak me ra sefha me din.
 
Our video finishes here, it ends. And be with us, another
episode, stone... don't forget, give likes and subscriptions
to us, to our page.

581
00:54:42,000 --> 00:54:46,000
Û eshabê we giyo moş dikim. Li dost û ehbaba jî bela kin.
 
And I kiss/greet all your friends. Share it with friends and
loved ones too.

582
00:54:46,000 --> 00:54:49,000
Û gotinok hene, xwestekek hene, me ra te'lîqê binivîsînin,
dîsa emê we ra... xwesteka ke hene, emê bicîbînin.
 
And if there are sayings, if there is a request, write in
the comments for us, again we will for you... whatever
request there is, we will fulfill it.

583
00:54:49,000 --> 00:54:54,000
Em î noko ber mal daren. Em qortok nîzîkî li şancî kûmir me
kirî. Em ê noko an mal.
 
We are now going towards home. We took a short cut near the
coal site. We will now go home.

